","text":{"de":"Ein Pixel auf der Matrix","en":"One pixel on the matrix","es":"Un píxel en la matriz","fr":"Un pixel sur la matrice","hi":"मैट्रिक्स पर एक पिक्सेल","zh":"点阵上的一个像素"}},{"icon":"code","text":{"de":"Eine LED an Ring 1","en":"An LED on ring 1","es":"Un LED en el anillo 1","fr":"Une LED sur l'anneau 1","hi":"छल्ला 1 पर एक LED","zh":"1 号环孔上的一颗 LED"}},{"icon":"clock","text":{"de":"Timing mit sleep()","en":"Timing with sleep()","es":"Tiempos con sleep()","fr":"La temporisation avec sleep()","hi":"sleep() से टाइमिंग","zh":"用 sleep() 计时"}}],"hints":[{"de":"Nichts auf dem Steckbrett? Vielleicht ist die LED verkehrt herum: Das lange Bein kommt an den Widerstand.","en":"Nothing on the breadboard? The LED may be backwards: the long leg goes to the resistor.","es":"¿No se enciende nada en la protoboard? Puede que el LED esté al revés: la pata larga va a la resistencia.","fr":"Rien sur la platine d'essai ? La LED est peut-être à l'envers : la patte longue va vers la résistance.","hi":"ब्रेडबोर्ड पर कुछ नहीं? हो सकता है LED उल्टी लगी हो: लंबी टाँग रेज़िस्टर की ओर जाती है।","zh":"面包板上的 LED 不亮？可能是 LED 接反了：长脚要接电阻。"},{"de":"set_pixel nimmt zuerst x, dann y, beide von 0 bis 4.","en":"set_pixel takes x first, then y, both from 0 to 4.","es":"set_pixel recibe primero x y luego y, las dos de 0 a 4.","fr":"set_pixel prend x d'abord, puis y, tous deux de 0 à 4.","hi":"set_pixel पहले x लेता है, फिर y, दोनों 0 से 4 तक।","zh":"set_pixel 先接收 x，再接收 y，都是 0 到 4。"},{"de":"Jedes sleep() pausiert für so viele Millisekunden.","en":"Each sleep() pauses for that many milliseconds.","es":"Cada sleep() hace una pausa de esos milisegundos.","fr":"Chaque sleep() fait une pause de ce nombre de millisecondes.","hi":"हर sleep() उतने मिलीसेकंड के लिए रुकता है।","zh":"每个 sleep() 会暂停相应的毫秒数。"}],"kind":"lesson","lede":{"de":"Lass die Mitte der Matrix und eine LED an Ring 1 zusammen leuchten und schalte sie dann wieder aus, einmal pro Sekunde.","en":"Light the centre of the matrix and an LED on ring 1 together, then turn them off, once a second.","es":"Enciende el centro de la matriz y un LED en el anillo 1 a la vez, y luego apágalos, una vez por segundo.","fr":"Allumez ensemble le centre de la matrice et une LED sur l'anneau 1, puis éteignez-les, une fois par seconde.","hi":"मैट्रिक्स का बीच वाला LED और छल्ला 1 पर लगी LED एक साथ जलाएँ, फिर बुझाएँ, हर सेकंड एक बार।","zh":"让点阵中心和 1 号环孔上的一颗 LED 一起点亮，然后熄灭，每秒一次。"},"legacyFigure":{"circuit":"blink","page":"/figures/boards/microbit-v2.html","sheets":["board","breadboard","schematic","power"]},"level":"io","order":1,"pins":[{"color":"yellow","pin":"P1","role":{"de":"Treibt die LED","en":"Drives the LED","es":"Controla el LED","fr":"Pilote la LED","hi":"LED चलाता है","zh":"驱动 LED"},"to":{"de":"Langes Bein der LED, über 470 Ω","en":"LED long leg, through 470 Ω","es":"Pata larga del LED, a través de 470 Ω","fr":"Patte longue de la LED, à travers 470 Ω","hi":"LED की लंबी टाँग, 470 Ω के ज़रिए","zh":"经过 470 Ω 接 LED 长脚"}},{"color":"black","pin":"GND","role":{"de":"Masse","en":"Ground","es":"Tierra","fr":"Masse","hi":"ग्राउंड","zh":"地"},"to":{"de":"Kurzes Bein der LED","en":"LED short leg","es":"Pata corta del LED","fr":"Patte courte de la LED","hi":"LED की छोटी टाँग","zh":"LED 短脚"}}],"quizzes":[{"id":"blink-quiz","questions":[{"answer":1,"id":"q1","options":[{"de":"Damit sie schneller blinkt","en":"To make it blink faster","es":"Para que parpadee más rápido","fr":"Pour la faire clignoter plus vite","hi":"उसे तेज़ी से ब्लिंक कराने के लिए","zh":"为了让它闪得更快"},{"de":"Um den Strom bei etwa 3 mA zu halten, die ein Pin des micro:bit liefern kann","en":"To keep the current near 3 mA, which a micro:bit pin can supply","es":"Para mantener la corriente cerca de 3 mA, que un pin de la micro:bit puede dar","fr":"Pour garder le courant vers 3 mA, ce qu'une broche de micro:bit peut fournir","hi":"करंट को लगभग 3 mA पर रखने के लिए, जितना micro:bit का पिन दे सकता है","zh":"为了让电流保持在 micro:bit 引脚能提供的 3 mA 左右"},{"de":"Weil die LED 5 V braucht","en":"Because the LED needs 5 V","es":"Porque el LED necesita 5 V","fr":"Parce que la LED a besoin de 5 V","hi":"क्योंकि LED को 5 V चाहिए","zh":"因为 LED 需要 5 V"}],"q":{"de":"Warum sitzt ein 470-Ω-Widerstand vor der LED?","en":"Why is there a 470 Ω resistor in front of the LED?","es":"¿Por qué hay una resistencia de 470 Ω delante del LED?","fr":"Pourquoi y a-t-il une résistance de 470 Ω devant la LED ?","hi":"LED के आगे 470 Ω रेज़िस्टर क्यों है?","zh":"为什么 LED 前面有一个 470 Ω 电阻？"},"why":{"de":"(3,3 V − 2 V) / 470 Ω sind etwa 2,8 mA. Ein Pin des V2 liefert 1 bis 4 mA, also würde eine LED ohne Widerstand zu viel von ihm verlangen.","en":"(3.3 V − 2 V) / 470 Ω is about 2.8 mA. A V2 pin gives 1 to 4 mA, so a bare LED would ask too much of it.","es":"(3,3 V − 2 V) / 470 Ω son unos 2,8 mA. Un pin de la V2 da de 1 a 4 mA, así que un LED sin resistencia le pediría demasiado.","fr":"(3,3 V − 2 V) / 470 Ω font environ 2,8 mA. Une broche de la V2 donne 1 à 4 mA : une LED seule lui en demanderait trop.","hi":"(3.3 V − 2 V) / 470 Ω लगभग 2.8 mA है। V2 का पिन 1 से 4 mA देता है, इसलिए बिना रेज़िस्टर की LED उससे बहुत ज़्यादा माँगेगी।","zh":"(3.3 V − 2 V) / 470 Ω 约为 2.8 mA。V2 的引脚提供 1 到 4 mA，所以不加电阻的 LED 会对它要求太多。"}},{"answer":0,"id":"q2","options":[{"de":"Lässt die mittlere LED mit voller Helligkeit leuchten","en":"Lights the middle LED at full brightness","es":"Enciende el LED del medio al brillo máximo","fr":"Allume la LED du milieu à pleine luminosité","hi":"बीच वाली LED को पूरी रोशनी पर जलाता है","zh":"以最大亮度点亮中间的 LED"},{"de":"Lässt zwei LEDs mit Helligkeit 2 leuchten","en":"Lights two LEDs at brightness 2","es":"Enciende dos LED con brillo 2","fr":"Allume deux LED à la luminosité 2","hi":"रोशनी 2 पर दो LED जलाता है","zh":"以亮度 2 点亮两颗 LED"},{"de":"Legt 9 V an Pin 2","en":"Puts 9 V on pin 2","es":"Pone 9 V en el pin 2","fr":"Met 9 V sur la broche 2","hi":"पिन 2 पर 9 V देता है","zh":"在 2 号引脚上加 9 V"}],"q":{"de":"Was macht display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9)?","en":"What does display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9) do?","es":"¿Qué hace display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9)?","fr":"Que fait display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9) ?","hi":"display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9) क्या करता है?","zh":"display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9) 做了什么？"},"why":{"de":"x und y zählen von 0 bis 4 ab der oberen linken Ecke, also ist (2, 2) die Mitte; die Helligkeit reicht von 0 bis 9.","en":"x and y count 0 to 4 from the top-left corner, so (2, 2) is the middle; brightness runs from 0 to 9.","es":"x e y cuentan de 0 a 4 desde la esquina de arriba a la izquierda, así que (2, 2) es el centro; el brillo va de 0 a 9.","fr":"x et y comptent de 0 à 4 depuis le coin supérieur gauche : (2, 2) est donc le milieu ; la luminosité va de 0 à 9.","hi":"x और y ऊपर-बाएँ कोने से 0 से 4 तक गिनते हैं, इसलिए (2, 2) बीच है; रोशनी 0 से 9 तक जाती है।","zh":"x 和 y 从左上角开始数 0 到 4，所以 (2, 2) 是正中间；亮度从 0 到 9。"}},{"answer":2,"id":"q3","options":[{"de":"500 ms","en":"500 ms","es":"500 ms","fr":"500 ms","hi":"500 ms","zh":"500 ms"},{"de":"250 ms","en":"250 ms","es":"250 ms","fr":"250 ms","hi":"250 ms","zh":"250 ms"},{"de":"1000 ms","en":"1000 ms","es":"1000 ms","fr":"1000 ms","hi":"1000 ms","zh":"1000 ms"}],"q":{"de":"Mit zweimal sleep(500) in der Schleife: Wie lange dauert ein ganzer Blinker?","en":"With sleep(500) twice in the loop, how long is one full blink?","es":"Con dos sleep(500) en el bucle, ¿cuánto dura un parpadeo completo?","fr":"Avec deux sleep(500) dans la boucle, combien dure un clignotement complet ?","hi":"लूप में दो बार sleep(500) हो तो एक पूरा ब्लिंक कितना लंबा है?","zh":"循环里有两个 sleep(500)，完整闪烁一次要多长时间？"},"why":{"de":"500 ms an plus 500 ms aus: ein Blinker pro Sekunde.","en":"500 ms on plus 500 ms off: one blink per second.","es":"500 ms encendido más 500 ms apagado: un parpadeo por segundo.","fr":"500 ms allumée plus 500 ms éteinte : un clignotement par seconde.","hi":"500 ms जली और 500 ms बुझी: हर सेकंड एक ब्लिंक।","zh":"亮 500 ms 加上灭 500 ms：每秒闪烁一次。"}}]}],"serialSample":{"baud":115200,"lines":[]},"specs":[{"label":{"de":"Periode","en":"Period","es":"Periodo","fr":"Période","hi":"पीरियड","zh":"周期"},"value":{"de":"1 s","en":"1 s","es":"1 s","fr":"1 s","hi":"1 s","zh":"1 s"}},{"label":{"de":"LED-Strom","en":"LED current","es":"Corriente del LED","fr":"Courant de la LED","hi":"LED का करंट","zh":"LED 电流"},"value":{"de":"Etwa 3 mA","en":"About 3 mA","es":"Unos 3 mA","fr":"Environ 3 mA","hi":"लगभग 3 mA","zh":"约 3 mA"}},{"label":{"de":"Pins","en":"Pins","es":"Pines","fr":"Broches","hi":"पिन","zh":"引脚"},"value":{"de":"P1, GND","en":"P1, GND","es":"P1, GND","fr":"P1, GND","hi":"P1, GND","zh":"P1、GND"}}],"starter":{"source":"src_main","template":"# Blink the middle LED and an LED on pin 1\nfrom microbit import *\n\nwhile True:\n    display.set_pixel(2, 2, 9)    # x, y from the top-left; brightness 0-9\n    pin1.write_digital(1)         # 3.3 V on ring 1\n    sleep({{p:ms}})\n    display.set_pixel(2, 2, 0)\n    pin1.write_digital(0)\n    sleep({{p:ms}})\n"},"steps":[{"de":"Klemm Ring 1 an den 470-Ω-Widerstand und den Widerstand an das lange Bein der LED.","en":"Clip ring 1 to the 470 Ω resistor and the resistor to the LED's long leg.","es":"Engancha el anillo 1 a la resistencia de 470 Ω y la resistencia a la pata larga del LED.","fr":"Reliez l'anneau 1 à la résistance de 470 Ω, et la résistance à la patte longue de la LED.","hi":"छल्ला 1 को 470 Ω रेज़िस्टर पर क्लिप करें और रेज़िस्टर को LED की लंबी टाँग पर।","zh":"把 1 号环孔夹到 470 Ω 电阻上，电阻再接到 LED 的长脚。"},{"de":"Klemm das kurze Bein der LED an den GND-Ring.","en":"Clip the LED's short leg to the GND ring.","es":"Engancha la pata corta del LED al anillo GND.","fr":"Reliez la patte courte de la LED à l'anneau GND.","hi":"LED की छोटी टाँग को GND छल्ले पर क्लिप करें।","zh":"把 LED 的短脚夹到 GND 环孔上。"},{"de":"Führ das Programm aus und beobachte die Mitte der Matrix und die LED.","en":"Run the program and watch the middle of the matrix and the LED.","es":"Ejecuta el programa y mira el centro de la matriz y el LED.","fr":"Lancez le programme et regardez le milieu de la matrice et la LED.","hi":"प्रोग्राम चलाएँ और मैट्रिक्स का बीच और LED देखें।","zh":"运行程序，观察点阵中间和那颗 LED。"},{"de":"Ändere den Zeit-Chip und sieh, wie schnell es blinkt.","en":"Change the time chip and see how fast it blinks.","es":"Cambia el selector del tiempo y mira a qué velocidad parpadea.","fr":"Changez la valeur de durée modifiable et voyez à quelle vitesse elle clignote.","hi":"समय वाली चिप बदलें और देखें कि यह कितनी तेज़ी से ब्लिंक करती है।","zh":"改一下时间选项，看看它闪得有多快。"}],"title":{"de":"Eine LED blinken lassen","en":"Blink an LED","es":"Haz parpadear un LED","fr":"Faire clignoter une LED","hi":"एक LED ब्लिंक कराएँ","zh":"闪烁一颗 LED"}},"history":{"baseChain":"3bc1c80206bb4e5ee0399fec84317277bae648aeb4e717e534a62dd2723e4d36","baseRevision":0,"checkpoints":[],"ops":[]},"id":"prj_microbit-v2-blink","license":{"spdx":"LicenseRef-iynk-pending"},"meta":{"createdAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","description":"Light the centre of the matrix and an LED on ring 1 together, then turn them off, once a second.","kind":"template","locale":"en","tags":["microbit-v2","lesson","io"],"title":"Blink an LED","updatedAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"nets":[{"class":"ground","connections":[{"c":"brd_main","p":"GND"},{"c":"cmp_led1","p":"K"}],"id":"net_gnd","name":"GND"},{"class":"signal","connections":[{"c":"cmp_led1","p":"A"},{"c":"cmp_r1","p":"P2"}],"id":"net_led1a_r1p2"},{"class":"signal","connections":[{"c":"brd_main","p":"P1"},{"c":"cmp_r1","p":"P1"}],"id":"net_p1","name":"P1"}],"parameters":[{"id":"par_ms","kind":"number","label":{"de":"An- und Aus-Zeit","en":"On and off time","es":"Tiempo encendido y apagado","fr":"Durée allumée et éteinte","hi":"जलने और बुझने का समय","zh":"亮和灭的时间"},"max":2000,"min":50,"name":"ms","step":50,"value":500}],"provenance":{"contributors":[],"createdBy":"usr_iynk","createdWith":{"app":"iynk","version":"0.1.0"},"origin":{"kind":"template","template":"microbit-v2-blink"},"thirdParty":[{"id":"tp1","kind":"text","review":"unchecked","source":{"title":"Third-party lesson sites named in D-0